# Title: Tamper With Sophos AV Registry Keys
# ID: 9f4662ac-17ca-43aa-8f12-5d7b989d0101
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2022-09-02
# Tags: attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1685
# Description: Detects tamper attempts to sophos av functionality via registry key modification
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog ((registry_key_name="*\\Sophos Endpoint Defense\\TamperProtection\\Config\\SAVEnabled*" OR registry_key_name="*\\Sophos Endpoint Defense\\TamperProtection\\Config\\SEDEnabled*" OR registry_key_name="*\\Sophos\\SAVService\\TamperProtection\\Enabled*") AND Details="DWORD (0x00000000)")
